# The gap watcher W fires twice when the piston pulls the block into its gap (the head enters, then
# the block arrives) and once when it pushes it back; the observer M watching the delay-2 repeater
# fires exactly once per lever flip in both cases (the repeater is on for 4 gt: t8..t11).
design designs/gadgets/pulse-merge.txt
probe w 3 2 0
probe rep 5 2 0
probe m 6 2 0
use 0 1 0
expect_trace w 000110011000000000000000
use 0 1 0
expect_trace w 000110000000000000000000
design designs/gadgets/pulse-merge.txt
probe w 3 2 0
probe rep 5 2 0
probe m 6 2 0
use 0 1 0
expect_trace m 000000000110000000000000
use 0 1 0
expect_trace m 000000000110000000000000
